$ jailops image rename freebsd-15 freebsd-15-0 -y
image/freebsd-15 renamed to freebsd-15-0 (2 references, 1 dataset changed)

$ jailops project rename main primary -y
project/main renamed to primary (4 references, 1 dataset changed)
remote t now uses project primary

